{"id":"620365","name":"牡丹八宝饭","author":"李小厨娘🍽","authorId":"9373846","desc":"","cover":"images/620365/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"糯米","amount":"1斤"}],"sub":[{"name":"葡萄干","amount":"100g"},{"name":"枸杞","amount":"20g"},{"name":"红枣","amount":"适量"},{"name":"蜜枣","amount":"几个"},{"name":"核桃","amount":"几个"},{"name":"豆沙馅","amount":"1包"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"红枣切开去核，围成想要的大小。","img":"images/620365/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"用保鲜膜裹紧。","img":"images/620365/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"准备配料。","img":"images/620365/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"糯米用水泡2-3小时。","img":"images/620365/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"上锅蒸30分钟。","img":"images/620365/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"红枣切开的样子。","img":"images/620365/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"碗底放一朵花，和其余配料。","img":"images/620365/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"蒸好的米+水+少许白酒搅拌均匀。","img":"images/620365/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"加一层米，一层豆沙馅。","img":"images/620365/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"在放上米，压紧。","img":"images/620365/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"上锅蒸1小时。","img":"images/620365/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"取出倒扣。","img":"images/620365/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"软糯香甜。","img":"images/620365/step_13.jpg"}],"tips":"拌米的时候可以加少许猪油，装碗的时候记得抹油（这些蒸了10碗左右） \n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：蒸锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}